Salus IT600 for Homey

The gateway protocol algorithms (AES-256-CBC, AES-128-CBC and AES-256-CCM
framing and key derivation) and the device parsing in this app are ported
from:

- salus-it600-client by Jordi-14 (MIT/Apache-2.0)
  https://github.com/Jordi-14/salus-it600-client
- pyit600 (MIT)
  https://github.com/epoplavskis/pyit600

Test vectors in test/fixtures/protocol-vectors.json were generated with
salus-it600-client 0.7.0.
